This repository holds no legal text yet: it records the sources for Costa Rica's law (SOURCES.md) before any law
is added. When legal text is added, this file will name its source and the terms it is published under. The source
listed now, SINALEVI (Procuraduría General de la República, https://www.sinalevi.go.cr), marks its pages "all
rights reserved".

Lexifina's own contributions (the documentation, the tables and any tools) are dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
